Best CBSE Schools in Bangalore: Overview
Bangalore has several reputed CBSE schools known for quality teaching, experienced faculty, modern infrastructure and strong extracurricular programmes. [1] The best CBSE schools in Bangalore are not the same for every family. The right choice depends on your child's needs, your budget and your locality. [1]

The Central Board of Secondary Education (CBSE) is a national board under the Ministry of Education, and affiliation is granted to schools on fulfilment of conditions set out in its affiliation bye-laws. [2] Government data shows that over 30,000 schools were affiliated to CBSE as of December 2024. [3]

Important for parents: before applying to any school, check that it is genuinely affiliated. CBSE has asked parents to verify affiliation through the Board's affiliation website, because some schools use phrases such as "CBSE pattern" without being affiliated. [2]


